{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Is this all just a dream? or something more...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i>It starts with waking up. It always does. What happens next can be determined by a number of variables, algorithms, conditions...</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636260/extras/image_2025-04-15_173514753.png?t=1744922389\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Walk and drive through the atmospheric world of<strong> SUBURBADROME,</strong>\u00a0a puzzle game and walking simulator with multiple endings and an intertwining story.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WATCH</strong> the fuel gauge of your car. Nobody wants to be stranded in the barren wastes of a suburb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636260/extras/imagecar.png?t=1744922389\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SIPHON</strong> other vehicles for gas, but be wary of the strange side effects of siphoning.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636260/extras/image.png?t=1744922389\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DISCOVER</strong> the inner workings of the world of SUBURBADROME through accessible terminals that slowly peel back the bandaged scars.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636260/extras/imgterminal.png?t=1744922389\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3636260?t=17449